.SH NAME
DUMP860 - Dumps parts of an iPSC\*R/860\fR\fR\fR\fR\& object file. 
.\" End Summary
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
\&\fBdump860\fR\fR\& [ \fR\fIoptions\fI\fR\& ] \fR\fIfilename\fI\fR\
\& 
.SH ARGUMENTS 
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fR\fIfilename\fI\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' The name of the iPSC/860\& object file. 
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.LP
You may specify the following \fR\fIoptions\fI\fR\& in any order:
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-a\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Display archive headers.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-g\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Display the archive symbol table.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-f\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Display file headers.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-o\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Dump (in formatted hexadecimal) optional headers.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-h\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Dump section headers.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-s\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Dump section data.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-r\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Dump relocation data.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-l\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Dump line numbers.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-t\fR\fR\& [ \fR\fInumber\fI\fR\& ] 	\h'-\w' 'u' Dump symbol table, starting at symbol index \fR\fI\
number\fI\fR\&. If the \fB\&+d\fR\fR\& option is not used, then only the single symbol is displayed.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-z\fR\fR\& \fR\fIname\fI\fR\&,\fR\fInumber\fI\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' \
Dump line numbers for function \fR\fIname\fI\fR\&, starting at line \fR\fI\
number\fI\fR\&.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-c\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Dump the string table.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-d\fR\fR\& \fR\fInumber\fI\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Dump section headers starting at section \fR\fI\
number\fI\fR\&. Only effective if the \fB\&-h\fR\fR\& option \
is also specified. Sections are numbered starting at \fR\fR\&1\fR\fR\
\&. If the \fB\&+d\fR\fR\& option is not specified, then only the single section header is dumped.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-n\fR\fR\& \fR\fIname\fI\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Dump only sections named \fR\fI\
name\fI\fR\&. Only effective if the \fB\&-h\fR\fR\& option is used.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-p\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Do not display headers.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-u\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Underline mode. Only works on devices supporting backspace.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-v\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Verbose mode. Display some headers and information in an easier-to-comprehend \
form.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&-V\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Display the tool banner (tool name, version, etc.).
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&+d\fR\fR\& \fR\fInumber\fI\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Dump section headers ending at section \fR\fI\
number\fI\fR\&. Only effective if the \fB\&-h\fR\fR\& option is \
used.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&+t\fR\fR\& \fR\fInumber\fI\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' Dump symbol table, through symbol index \fR\fI\
number\fI\fR\&. If \fB\&-t\fR\fR\& was not specified, the start index is zero.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.ta 1.0i 5.9i
.HP 1i
\fB\&+z\fR\fR\& \fR\fInumber \fI\fR	\h'-\w' 'u' Dump line numbers for function \fR\fI\
name\fI\fR\& (specified by \fB\&-z\fR\fR\&), ending at line \fR\fI\
number\fI\fR\&.
.RE
.ta 0.50i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i +0.5i
.SH DESCRIPTION
.LP
Use \fBdump860\fR\fR\& to dump (in formatted hexadecimal) parts of the named object file. 
.SH SEE ALSO
.LP
\fBar860\fR\fR\&, \fBas860\fR\fR\&, \fBicc\fR\fR\&, \fBif77\fR\fR\
\&, \fBld860\fR\fR\&, \fBnm860\fR\fR\&, \fBsize860\fR\fR\&, \fB\
strip860\fR\fR\& 
.LP
\fR\fR
.LP
.LP
\fR\fR
